  },
  "$defs":{"hash":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$"}},
  "$comment":"Executable contract.py imposes exact nested field sets, strict Python number types, fixed settings/runtime/device/scope, all digests and quotas; it is normative alongside this structural schema. Duplicate JSON keys and nonfinite values are rejected by loads."
